                <td bgcolor="#333333" valign="top"><font color="#FFFFFF" face="Trebuchet MS, Tahoma, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"><small>Posted&nbsp;-&nbsp;09/24/2004&nbsp;: 8:23:31 PM</small><hr size="1"><span class="spnMessageText"> Also note that the interface is skinnable so the default that you see there can be modified to a great degree.  It can even include custom windows and buttons similar to what can be done with DAoC and (from my understanding) can now be done with EQ.<br /><br /><font color="green">The Olive Grape</font id="green"><br />Molieren - Treasurer and Prophet<br /><img src="http://www.monstarla.com/images/moli.jpg" border="0"><br /></span></font></td>
